00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:07.270
<i>She excels at sports, she's popular, 
and she's charismatic.</i>

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:09.730
<i>She handles all the housework, too.</i>

00:02:09.730 --> 00:02:12.090
<i>Honestly, it'd be easier to list 
the things she </i>isn't<i> good at.</i>

00:02:12.090 --> 00:02:15.160
<i>This goody two-shoes of a sister holds 
me to her impossibly high standards,</i>

00:02:15.160 --> 00:02:18.600
<i>so, of course, she's super strict 
with me and nitpicks everything.</i>

00:02:19.910 --> 00:02:22.660
Your shirt button is about to fall off, too.

00:02:22.660 --> 00:02:26.180
I don't have time to fix it right now, 
so give it to me when you get home.

00:02:26.180 --> 00:02:27.470
I'll resew it for you.

00:02:27.470 --> 00:02:29.270
Okay, okay, I hear you.

00:02:29.740 --> 00:02:31.670
Have you washed your face?

00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:34.670
N-No, not yet...

00:02:37.650 --> 00:02:38.670
I'll go do that now.

00:02:42.840 --> 00:02:45.930
<i>In a typical relationship between 
a brother and younger sister</i>

00:02:45.930 --> 00:02:48.400
