would say things like:</i>

00:02:45.930 --> 00:02:48.990
If you keep thinking your college 
entrance exams are a long way off,

00:02:48.400 --> 00:02:53.890
<i>"Sheesh! What </i>am<i> I going to do with you?" 
while bending to his little sister's whims.</i>

00:02:48.990 --> 00:02:50.780
they'll creep up on you before you know it.

00:02:50.780 --> 00:02:52.500
