00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:56.330
At the rate you're going, you'll be 
a slacker when you leave school.

00:02:53.890 --> 00:02:55.690
<i>But we're anything but typical.</i>

00:02:57.090 --> 00:02:58.880
Hey! Are you even listening to me?!

00:02:58.880 --> 00:02:59.700
Yes.

00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:01.570
