00:03:12.880 --> 00:03:14.340
Big brother...

00:03:14.340 --> 00:03:15.940
Huh? What is it?

00:03:15.940 --> 00:03:18.880
Never mind. See you later.

00:03:19.690 --> 00:03:20.880
