00:10:18.630 --> 00:10:20.890
T-Talk? To me?

00:10:21.960 --> 00:10:24.260
Do you see anyone else in here?

00:10:24.260 --> 00:10:28.790
W-Well, there <i>could</i> be a beautiful girl in the 
other world that's connected to my closet...

00:10:28.790 --> 00:10:31.400
I have no idea what you're talking about.

00:10:32.460 --> 00:10:34.600
Anyway, we need to talk.

00:10:34.600 --> 00:10:35.650
Can I come in?

00:10:35.860 --> 00:10:37.530
Huh? Into my <i>room?!</i>

00:10:37.530 --> 00:10:39.720
Why is that so shocking?

00:10:39.720 --> 00:10:41.930
Have you got something in 
there you don't want me to see?

00:10:41.930 --> 00:10:45.950
N-No... n-not really...

00:10:46.400 --> 00:10:47.860
I'm not sure I believe you.

00:10:47.860 --> 00:10:49.330
Th-There isn't!

00:10:49.550 --> 00:10:50.990
Then, excuse the intrusion.

00:10:54.520 --> 00:10:56.920
Oh, you tidied up today.

00:11:00.760 --> 00:11:04.760
Is it just my imagination or did you sit
 on my bed without a second thought?

00:11:05.000 --> 00:11:08.170
Well, there's only one chair 
in your room, isn't there?

00:11:08.170 --> 00:11:09.770
That's true, but...

00:11:10.070 --> 00:11:12.820
Hey, wait. You just said I'd tidied up today.

00:11:12.820 --> 00:11:14.770
But you've never been in my room before...

00:11:14.770 --> 00:11:15.990
Maybe you misheard me.

00:11:15.990 --> 00:11:16.850
No, I know what you sa—

00:11:16.850 --> 00:11:18.530
You misheard me, big brother!

00:11:18.530 --> 00:11:20.530
W-Well, whatever.

00:11:21.840 --> 00:11:26.030
So what on earth can be so bad that 
you have to come to me for advice?

00:11:26.030 --> 00:11:29.560
You've been submitting manuscripts to 
those new author contests, right?

00:11:29.560 --> 00:11:30.460
Y-Yeah...

00:11:30.460 --> 00:11:33.420
I have, but what does that 
have to do with anything?

00:11:33.420 --> 00:11:35.420
I... won...

00:11:35.420 --> 00:11:37.170
Huh? You what?

00:11:38.890 --> 00:11:44.640
I... well... I won first place!

00:11:48.600 --> 00:11:50.980
What?!

00:11:49.470 --> 00:11:50.980
<b>My Sister, 
My Writer</b>

00:11:51.530 --> 00:11:53.280
Wh-What do you mean?!

00:11:53.280 --> 00:11:56.750
You won?! You won the 
Sumeragi Fantasy contest?!

00:11:56.750 --> 00:11:57.860
What kinda joke is this?!

00:11:57.860 --> 00:12:00.050
It's not a joke. It's the truth.

00:12:00.050 --> 00:12:01.740
S-Seriously?

00:12:01.740 --> 00:12:04.240
You've been writing novels?

00:12:04.240 --> 00:12:08.240
I wasn't <i>actively</i> writing. I just 
submitted a novel I happened to write.

00:12:08.240 --> 00:12:09.790
A novel you "happened" to write?

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:13.250
You left one of your paperbacks 
in the living room a while back.

00:12:13.250 --> 00:12:14.580
<b>Sumeragi Fantasy</b>

00:12:13.250 --> 00:12:14.580
<b>New Light Novel 
Author Awards</b>

00:12:13.560 --> 00:12:15.740
I caught sight of the last page,

00:12:15.740 --> 00:12:18.000
which said they were taking 
manuscript submissions.

00:12:15.920 --> 00:12:18.000
<b>Seeking Submissions!</b>

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:22.880
So you submitted the very first manuscript 
you ever wrote, and won first prize with it?

00:12:22.880 --> 00:12:23.560
Yes.

00:12:23.560 --> 00:12:26.610
I'd been getting calls from 
a number I didn't recognize,

00:12:25.890 --> 00:12:28.390
Sender: Sumeragi Fantasy Bunko First Editing Department

00:12:25.890 --> 00:12:28.390
[Important] Sumeragi Fantasy New Author Awards Notice

00:12:25.890 --> 00:12:28.390
Towano Chikai,

00:12:25.890 --> 00:12:28.390
Please forgive the suddenness of this correspondence. 
I am Shinozaki Reika. I'll be your first port of call as your editor at the Sumeragi 
Fantasy Bunko Editing Department. 
The title you submitted to the Sumeragi Fantasy Awards: 
"This is the Tale of a Little Sister Who Loves Her Brother Too Much to Cope," 
has won first place in the Sumeragi Fantasy Awards. 
My apologies for notifying you over email, but I wanted to congratulate you 
on winning as soon as possible. 
Also, sorry if this seems sudden, but I'd like to discuss this further with you 
over the phone, so I would be grateful if you could tell me what times are convenient for you. 
Thank you very much for your cooperation.

00:12:26.610 --> 00:12:29.600
so I just ignored them until 
I got this e-mail last night.

00:12:31.860 --> 00:12:34.650
<i>That call is the one I've been 
fantasizing about since forever!</i>

00:12:34.650 --> 00:12:38.390
<i>Getting a call from an unknown 
number would be shocking, though!</i>

00:12:38.390 --> 00:12:39.400
<i>Hey, wait...</i>

00:12:39.400 --> 00:12:41.550
You nearly had me fooled!

00:12:41.550 --> 00:12:43.400
Huh? What's gotten into you, big brother?

00:12:43.830 --> 00:12:46.580
I just looked at the list of titles that won!

00:12:46.580 --> 00:12:48.780
S-So you already saw?

00:12:48.780 --> 00:12:50.180
You bet I did.

00:12:50.180 --> 00:12:51.720
The first-placed novel was:

00:12:51.720 --> 00:12:56.290
"This is the Tale of a Little Sister Who 
Loves Her Brother Too Much to Cope."

00:12:59.200 --> 00:13:02.790
There's no way you'd write a story about
loving an older brother that much...

00:13:02.790 --> 00:13:04.800
Hm? What's this?

00:13:04.800 --> 00:13:07.010
"This is the Tale of a Little Sister Who
 Loves Her Brother Too Much to Cope."

00:13:05.050 --> 00:13:07.460
The manuscript... for that novel.

00:13:07.460 --> 00:13:08.050
What?!

00:13:09.510 --> 00:13:11.750
<i>I-It looks real.</i>

00:13:12.560 --> 00:13:14.340
Do you believe me now?

00:13:14.810 --> 00:13:17.370
H-Hold on, I'll read a bit of it.

00:13:19.820 --> 00:13:23.020
<i>The main character, Ryou, is 
a multi-talented, handsome young man,</i>

00:13:23.020 --> 00:13:27.320
<i>which is unusual for a protagonist, 
but I get no bad vibes from him.</i>

00:13:27.760 --> 00:13:31.670
<i>The heroine – his little sister, 
Yuuka – is timid and fragile,</i>

00:13:31.670 --> 00:13:35.330
<i>but her proactive approach to their 
relationship leaves a good impression.</i>

00:13:35.330 --> 00:13:38.960
"I love you, you know, big brother?"

00:13:35.330 --> 00:13:38.960
"The space next to you is a 
special spot reserved for me."

00:13:35.330 --> 00:13:38.960
"This may be embarrassing, 
but if <i>you're</i> the one looking 
at me, then... it's fine."

00:13:35.520 --> 00:13:38.960
<i>To be honest, it's a romantic comedy without 
any twists... but it's still interesting!</i>

00:13:39.340 --> 00:13:41.620
<i>It's on a whole other level from 
the novels I've read so far.</i>

00:13:41.620 --> 00:13:44.590
<i>Also, this little sister 
is too cute for words!</i>

00:13:44.870 --> 00:13:46.590
How is it?

00:13:46.850 --> 00:13:48.520
Well, it's gre—

00:13:49.650 --> 00:13:51.300
It's okay, I guess.

00:13:51.300 --> 00:13:53.860
I've only read half of it, 
so I haven't made up my mind yet.

00:13:54.390 --> 00:13:58.100
Is that so? But you believe me now, don't you?

00:13:58.560 --> 00:14:00.650
Y-Yeah, I do.

00:14:00.650 --> 00:14:02.070
Wait, no, no, no!

00:14:02.070 --> 00:14:03.280
If you had, that would mean...

00:14:03.520 --> 00:14:08.920
"Teehee! My mind goes all happy and 
blank when Big Brother pats my head."

00:14:08.920 --> 00:14:13.190
"I really wish he'd pat me some more!"

00:14:13.190 --> 00:14:15.040
...was written by you?

00:14:15.040 --> 00:14:18.920
Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-Why 
are you reading it out loud?!

00:14:18.920 --> 00:14:21.120
You have no tact, big brother!

00:14:21.120 --> 00:14:22.600
But this one reads...

00:14:22.600 --> 00:14:25.090
"The truth is, I love my big brother"—

00:14:25.360 --> 00:14:27.590
Please stop reading it out loud already!

00:14:29.090 --> 00:14:32.760
Ahem. Pardon me. I lost my composure there.

00:14:32.760 --> 00:14:35.810
For the time being, 
I'll believe that you wrote this.

00:14:35.810 --> 00:14:37.350
But, I mean, why?

00:14:37.350 --> 00:14:41.160
Why did you write 
a flirty sibling romance

00:14:41.160 --> 00:14:43.730
when it's a theme so far outside 
your own frame of reference?

00:14:43.730 --> 00:14:45.050
B-Because...

00:14:45.050 --> 00:14:45.730
Because?

00:14:47.320 --> 00:14:47.740
I...

00:14:47.740 --> 00:14:48.740
"I...."?

00:14:48.740 --> 00:14:50.210
I was possessed!

00:14:50.210 --> 00:14:52.490
Huh? Y-You were possessed?

00:14:52.490 --> 00:14:54.210
Y-Yes! That's right!

00:14:54.210 --> 00:14:56.190
I was possessed!

00:14:56.190 --> 00:15:02.000
L-Listen. The fact I was possessed is
 important, so please remember that!

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:06.680
Otherwise, there's no way I would've 
written a story about a little sister

00:15:06.680 --> 00:15:08.760
who's secretly been in love 
with her brother for years!

00:15:08.760 --> 00:15:13.510
Th-That may be true, but 
that's not really an explanation.

00:15:13.510 --> 00:15:19.250
Are you trying tell me that you think I...

00:15:19.250 --> 00:15:24.100
U-Um, that I l-l-love you like the 
little sister in my novel does?

00:15:24.100 --> 00:15:25.150
Is that what you think?!

00:15:25.380 --> 00:15:26.140
No...

00:15:27.400 --> 00:15:29.510
I hate you, big brother!

00:15:31.580 --> 00:15:33.450
No, I don't think that.

00:15:33.760 --> 00:15:35.460
That's okay, then.

00:15:36.910 --> 00:15:38.580
So what did you want to discuss?

00:15:38.970 --> 00:15:39.750
Oh, yes.

00:15:40.280 --> 00:15:44.460
Actually, as it stands, there are obstacles 
in the way of me becoming an author.

00:15:44.460 --> 00:15:46.540
Huh? Wh-What obstacles?

00:15:46.540 --> 00:15:47.960
There are two issues.

00:15:48.170 --> 00:15:51.720
The first is that my school forbids 
its students from having part-time jobs.

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:55.850
Article 19: Respect each other's human rights
 and behave properly as a student of this school.

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:55.850
Article 20: Part-time jobs are prohibited.

00:15:51.930 --> 00:15:55.850
As the student body president, 
I can't afford to break the rules.

00:15:57.050 --> 00:15:59.070
The second is our parents.

00:15:59.070 --> 00:16:02.800
Mother might be fine with it, but Father 
will most certainly be against it.

00:16:02.800 --> 00:16:04.520
He's very strict, after all.

00:16:05.230 --> 00:16:07.030
You're right there.

00:16:07.030 --> 00:16:09.610
Dad adores you to death.

00:16:09.610 --> 00:16:11.140
Those are the issues.

00:16:11.670 --> 00:16:15.240
Okay, but what do <i>you</i> want to do, Suzuka?

00:16:15.470 --> 00:16:16.630
I...

00:16:17.280 --> 00:16:20.870
I want a lot more people to read my creation.

00:16:20.870 --> 00:16:21.920
I see.

00:16:21.920 --> 00:16:23.450
Then, we can work together to—

00:16:23.450 --> 00:16:25.250
No, there's no need for that.

00:16:25.760 --> 00:16:28.160
I've already had an idea.

00:16:28.160 --> 00:16:29.750
That's what I wanted 
to talk to you about.

00:16:32.790 --> 00:16:37.620
Big brother... Would you be my stand-in?

00:16:38.770 --> 00:16:41.520
Huh? Your stand-in?

00:16:41.700 --> 00:16:45.340
I want you to claim to be 
the author in my stead.

00:16:45.340 --> 00:16:46.730
Oh, I see...

00:16:46.730 --> 00:16:50.860
That would get around the issues 
with your school and with Dad...

00:16:50.860 --> 00:16:52.780
But why me?

00:16:53.030 --> 00:16:54.700
W-Well...

00:16:54.700 --> 00:16:58.240
Because you're probably already 
familiar with the industry,

00:16:58.240 --> 00:17:02.080
and because there's no one 
else I can rely on to do this.

00:17:02.520 --> 00:17:06.240
You <i>do</i> realize it's my dream to 
become a light novel author, don't you?

00:17:06.240 --> 00:17:08.150
I can't do that with another person's work...

00:17:08.150 --> 00:17:11.710
But... you're the only person I can 
ask to do this for me, big brother!

00:17:16.100 --> 00:17:19.260
<i>I can't forsake Suzuka 
when she's like this.</i>

00:17:22.080 --> 00:17:24.890
Fine! I'll be your stand-in 
if that's what you want!

00:17:25.130 --> 00:17:26.640
Big brother!

00:17:26.640 --> 00:17:30.370
On one condition! I'll only do it 
until I win the award on my own.

00:17:30.370 --> 00:17:31.760
Oh... Yes!

00:17:31.760 --> 00:17:34.020
I'll gladly accept those terms.

00:17:34.020 --> 00:17:35.840
Sorry to throw you in at the deep end,

00:17:35.840 --> 00:17:38.880
but there's an awards ceremony in a 
few days, so please be sure to attend.

00:17:38.880 --> 00:17:40.280
The awards ceremony is that soon?!

00:17:44.040 --> 00:17:46.470
<i>I finally get to be at an awards ceremony...</i>

00:17:46.470 --> 00:17:47.170
Excuse me.

00:17:47.400 --> 00:17:50.670
You're Towano Chikai, correct?

00:17:50.670 --> 00:17:56.800
Oh, y-yes. I... I-I'm Nagami—
No, I mean, Towano Chikai.

00:17:56.800 --> 00:18:00.430
I'm your editor, Shinozaki Reika. 
Nice to meet you.

00:18:00.810 --> 00:18:02.810
I-It's a pleasure to be working with you.

00:18:03.240 --> 00:18:03.900
Hm...

00:18:04.560 --> 00:18:07.810
<i>Huh? I-Is she doubting that I am who I say I am?</i>

00:18:07.810 --> 00:18:09.810
This may sound a little rude,

00:18:09.810 --> 00:18:11.440
but are you still a virgin?

00:18:12.690 --> 00:18:15.840
I-I-I'm sorry! You're right! 
I didn't mean to deceive you!

00:18:15.840 --> 00:18:17.320
Huh? A virgin?

00:18:17.320 --> 00:18:18.450
I figured as much.

00:18:18.950 --> 00:18:23.160
The fact that you're a virgin helps you 
dream up all those desire-heavy situations.

00:18:23.160 --> 00:18:26.670
And yet, you still possess enough 
talent to make others read about them.

00:18:26.670 --> 00:18:29.210
Hm? Why are you bowing?

00:18:30.690 --> 00:18:34.960
My dad was very strict about apologizing 
to anyone who found out I was a virgin.

00:18:34.960 --> 00:18:37.440
<i>Wh-What on earth am I even saying?</i>

00:18:37.970 --> 00:18:41.050
Oh? What an interesting concept.

00:18:41.050 --> 00:18:44.680
I feel like I've caught a glimpse into 
how a genius like you came to be.

00:18:44.680 --> 00:18:46.100
<i>Huh?! She believed that?!</i>

00:18:46.680 --> 00:18:48.350
You're an author who has given birth

00:18:48.350 --> 00:18:51.200
to a truly wonderful title, so you 
couldn't have led a normal life.

00:18:51.200 --> 00:18:55.610
You're a man of talent who comes about 
once in a decade — no, once in a <i>century</i>.

00:18:55.830 --> 00:18:57.780
I swear on my career as an editor

00:18:57.780 --> 00:19:01.280
that I'll bring your work to 
people all around the world.

00:19:01.280 --> 00:19:04.120
Though, truth be told, you're my first charge.

00:19:04.460 --> 00:19:06.620
Oh, this woman is nuts.

00:19:06.620 --> 00:19:07.620
Pardon me.

00:19:08.560 --> 00:19:09.180
Huh?

00:19:09.960 --> 00:19:12.280
This is what a woman's breast feels like.

00:19:12.280 --> 00:19:13.590
Remember it well.

00:19:13.590 --> 00:19:15.840
Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-What are you doing?!

00:19:16.140 --> 00:19:18.440
It's for your novel.

00:19:18.440 --> 00:19:23.090
Knowing what breasts feel like will have 
a huge impact on your work, won't it?

00:19:23.310 --> 00:19:26.100
If you don't mind using mine, 
you can grope them whenever you like.

00:19:26.620 --> 00:19:28.050
There's no need to get so worked up.

00:19:28.050 --> 00:19:31.960
I'm prepared to do whatever it takes 
to make your work better.

00:19:31.960 --> 00:19:33.520
Even if you're doing it for the novel...

00:19:33.520 --> 00:19:35.240
Is that the time?

00:19:35.240 --> 00:19:37.040
The ceremony's about to start, so let's go.

00:19:37.040 --> 00:19:37.440
Hey!

00:19:37.730 --> 00:19:40.400
<i>Ah, this woman goes at her own pace.</i>

00:19:45.870 --> 00:19:49.790
Now then, ladies and gentlemen, 
please feel free to mingle for a while.

00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:53.560
<i>I feel like I'm dying out here...</i>

00:19:53.560 --> 00:19:55.920
There you are, Towano Chikai.

00:19:56.720 --> 00:20:03.720
This is the woman we've asked to 
illustrate your work: Ahegao Double Peace.

00:20:03.720 --> 00:20:09.200
Nice to you meet you. I'm Ahegao 
Double Peace. I'll be your illustrator.

00:20:09.200 --> 00:20:14.060
Whoa! I-I didn't realize Ahegao Double 
Peace was a beautiful young woman!

00:20:16.440 --> 00:20:20.650
Hearing you call me beautiful 
makes me so happy, I could orgasm!

00:20:20.650 --> 00:20:23.400
"Orgasm"? Wh-What are you saying?!

00:20:24.500 --> 00:20:26.610
Your reactions are so <i>cute</i>!

00:20:26.610 --> 00:20:30.420
Oh? You're already familiar 
with Ahegao's work?

00:20:30.420 --> 00:20:34.040
I-I know of her because 
my coworker's a huge fan.

00:20:34.040 --> 00:20:35.630
Oh, really?

00:20:35.630 --> 00:20:37.670
Your coworker has excellent taste.

00:20:37.880 --> 00:20:39.420
Excellent taste, huh?

00:20:39.420 --> 00:20:42.160
Shinozaki-kun! A moment of your time?

00:20:42.160 --> 00:20:44.500
Yes! I'll be right there, chief.

00:20:45.010 --> 00:20:46.890
I'm sorry, Towano.

00:20:46.890 --> 00:20:50.000
I need to introduce Ahegao 
to a few other people,

00:20:50.000 --> 00:20:51.180
so you'll have to excuse us.

00:20:51.180 --> 00:20:51.810
S-Sure.

00:20:53.810 --> 00:20:56.770
See you later, Towano!

00:20:59.200 --> 00:21:00.940
I've seen that guy somewhere before...

00:21:02.950 --> 00:21:06.700
Guess I'll read the latest winning 
novel to see what kind of story it is.

00:21:07.350 --> 00:21:08.320
I'm home.

00:21:09.520 --> 00:21:12.560
Welcome home, and good work, big brother.

00:21:12.560 --> 00:21:14.580
How was the awards ceremony?

00:21:14.580 --> 00:21:16.060
I managed to survive it somehow.

00:21:16.580 --> 00:21:19.040
For now, here's your 
certificate and the prize.

00:21:19.330 --> 00:21:22.200
I'm pooped, so I'm gonna call it a day.

00:21:22.200 --> 00:21:23.800
We can discuss the details tomorrow.

00:21:27.240 --> 00:21:29.850
<i>Thank you so much, big brother.</i>

00:21:38.560 --> 00:21:43.280
The story of my love for my big brother 
is going to spread worldwide!

00:21:43.710 --> 00:21:47.150
That means the whole world will approve
of us getting together, doesn't it?!

00:21:53.100 --> 00:21:57.210
Th-This is the best thing ever!

00:21:57.210 --> 00:22:01.210
This is the perfect chance 
to become his girlfriend!

00:23:34.930 --> 00:23:44.940
Illustration: Nitta Yasunari

00:23:36.150 --> 00:23:37.710
Yes, hello! Esaka-san here!

00:23:37.710 --> 00:23:39.310
I'm going to go over everyone here!

00:23:39.310 --> 00:23:40.100
What are we doing?

00:23:40.100 --> 00:23:41.550
First up is Nagamin!

00:23:41.550 --> 00:23:42.560
Answer my question!

00:23:42.560 --> 00:23:45.360
You're incredible, putting out a 
work with that legendary sister!

00:23:44.060 --> 00:23:49.940
Next Episode

00:23:44.060 --> 00:23:49.940
My Little Sister Aims for the Greatest Heights

00:23:45.360 --> 00:23:46.230
"Legendary" sister?

00:23:46.230 --> 00:23:47.400
See you next week!

00:23:47.400 --> 00:23:49.370
There was no point in me 
being here, was there?!
